{"meta":{"id":"tt1130884","type":"movie","name":"La Isla Siniestra","imdb_id":"tt1130884","description":"En el verano de 1954, los agentes judiciales Teddy Daniels (DiCaprio) y Chuck Aule (Ruffalo) son destinados a una remota isla del puerto de Boston para investigar la desaparición de una peligrosa asesina (Mortimer) que estaba recluida en el hospital psiquiátrico Ashecliffe, un centro penitenciario para criminales perturbados dirigido por el siniestro doctor John Cawley (Kingsley). Pronto descubrirán que el centro guarda muchos secretos y que la isla esconde algo más peligroso que los pacientes.","poster":"https://btttr.cc/poster-q/imdb/poster-default/tt1130884.jpg?tag=none&lang=es-MX&rs=IM","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lavdyiJWciCJvyLG37ZOs6HJijg.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cQQ0z6r8UXDz9Gd7sTITxWkdjxQ.png","genres":["Drama","Suspense","Misterio"],"releaseInfo":"2010","released":"2010-02-14T12:00:00.000Z","status":"Released","runtime":"138 min","imdbRating":"8.2","country":"United States of America","cast":["Leonardo DiCaprio","Mark Ruffalo","Ben Kingsley","Max von Sydow","Michelle Williams","Emily Mortimer","Patricia Clarkson","Jackie Earle Haley","Ted Levine","John Carroll Lynch","Elias Koteas","Robin Bartlett","Christopher Denham","Nellie Sciutto","Joseph Sikora","Curtiss Cook","Raymond Anthony Thomas","Joseph McKenna","Ruby Jerins","Tom Kemp","Bates Wilder","Lars Gerhard","Matthew Cowles","Jill Larson","Ziad Akl","Dennis Lynch","John Porell","Aidan Cole Mitchell","Drew Beasley","Joseph P. Reidy"],"director":["Martin Scorsese"],"writer":["Dennis Lehane","Laeta Kalogridis"],"trailers":[{"source":"vmvDCDC9Ylc","type":"Trailer","name":"Shutter Island (2010) trailer español","ytId":"vmvDCDC9Ylc","lang":"es"},{"source":"qdPw9x9h5CY","type":"Trailer","name":"Trailer","ytId":"qdPw9x9h5CY","lang":"en"}],"trailerStreams":[{"ytId":"vmvDCDC9Ylc","title":"Shutter Island (2010) trailer español"},{"ytId":"qdPw9x9h5CY","title":"Traile